{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish and Decorate Rooms</h2>Create unique rooms that meet every guest's expectations. Choose from a wide range of furniture, decorations, and styles - from modern to classic and themed. Your creativity will determine the hotel's unique character and high guest ratings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Mini Guest Shop</h2>Expand your services by creating a shop with snacks, souvenirs, and everyday items. Manage inventory, set prices, and maintain order so guests feel comfortable and eager to take advantage of additional offers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanliness and Comfort at the Highest Level</h2>Regular cleaning of rooms and common areas is key to guest satisfaction. Maintain cleanliness and stock up on essential supplies to make guests feel at home \u2013 this is the foundation of good reviews and repeat bookings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hotel Expansion and Prestige</h2>Invest in improvements and expand your hotel by adding new rooms, attractive amenities like a spa or gym, and unique features. Increase your reputation and revenue by creating the perfect place for your dream vacation.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969020?t=1760099521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969020/43b5e5a44a074e8aca92c3ef505bf584b750280c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760099521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969020/ceb7d412742aa1f28b36cce3ff59eda5449d8720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760099521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969020/ceb7d412742aa1f28b36cce3ff59eda5449d8720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760099521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Furnish and Decorate Rooms</h2>Create unique rooms that meet every guest's expectations. Choose from a wide range of furniture, decorations, and styles - from modern to classic and themed. Your creativity will determine the hotel's unique character and high guest ratings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run a Mini Guest Shop</h2>Expand your services by creating a shop with snacks, souvenirs, and everyday items. Manage inventory, set prices, and maintain order so guests feel comfortable and eager to take advantage of additional offers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cleanliness and Comfort at the Highest Level</h2>Regular cleaning of rooms and common areas is key to guest satisfaction. Maintain cleanliness and stock up on essential supplies to make guests feel at home \u2013 this is the foundation of good reviews and repeat bookings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hotel Expansion and Prestige</h2>Invest in improvements and expand your hotel by adding new rooms, attractive amenities like a spa or gym, and unique features. Increase your reputation and revenue by creating the perfect place for your dream vacation.","developers":["Digital Melody"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3969010","name":"My Hotel Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969020/0ac059fa97f3efec406c3365488e356af3e75586/header.jpg?t=1760099521","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3969020/616581718/31d0d9be9faa724c7b45b924517f947eb53c080c/1759064178/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759926375","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3969020/616581718/31d0d9be9faa724c7b45b924517f947eb53c080c/1759064178/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759926375","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3969020/616581718/31d0d9be9faa724c7b45b924517f947eb53c080c/1759064178/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759926375","id":257207859,"mp4":{"480":"htt